ighlighted WHEN I load the portfolio the first time THEN the About Me title and section are selected by default WHEN I am presented with the About Me section THEN I see a recent photo of the developer and a short bio about me WHEN I am presented with the Portfolio section THEN I see titled images of three of the developer\u2019s applications with links to both the deployed applications and the corresponding GitHub repository WHEN I am presented with the Contact section THEN I see a contact form with fields for a name, an email address, and a message WHEN I move my cursor out of one of the form fields without entering text THEN I receive a notification that this field is required WHEN I enter text into the email address field THEN I receive a notification if I have entered an invalid email address WHEN I view the footer THEN I am presented with text or icon links to the developer\u2019s GitHub and LinkedIn profiles.  In the project directory, you can run: npm start Runs the app in the development mode. Open http://localhost:3000 to view it in your browser.  The page will reload when you make changes. You may also see any lint errors in the console.","topics":[],"score":217937,"global_rank":219666},{"name":"carolyvn/note-taker","owner":"carolyvn","html_url":"https://github.com/carolyvn/note-taker","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":217937,"global_rank":219667},{"name":"kenneth-bakke/address-book","owner":"kenneth-bakke","html_url":"https://github.com/kenneth-bakke/address-book","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":217937,"global_rank":219684},{"name":"PastaShock/express-note-taker","owner":"PastaShock","html_url":"https://github.com/PastaShock/express-note-taker","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":217937,"global_rank":219686},{"name":"zehrl/burger","owner":"